<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Make me an overcomer</l><l>One with Christ in His victory!</l><l>The evil one in this world</l><l>Can never, ever be greater than He is.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Make me an overcomer</l><l>That my soul-life I would deny.</l><l>Each day and every moment</l><l>Overcoming by Your life.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
